#X text 57 13 Mother Patch. This patch is the bridge between the hardware and Pd. Without it open the Organelle does not work. In this Zynthian version the computer keyboard can be used to send note messages. The two octaves are on two rows \, the upper starting with 'Q' and the lower starting with 'Z'. The Aux button is '1'. You can simulate knob input using the sliders.;
#N canvas 426 337 1206 510 open_organelle_patch 0;
#X obj 464 329 symbol;
#X obj 542 330 file patchpath;
#X obj 465 366 pack s s;
#X msg 465 394 \; pd open \$1 \$2;
#X obj 558 290 symbol;
#X obj 177 72 text define -k newpatch;
#A set # path_to_organelle_patch name_of_main_patch --- do not delete this line \; GranularFreezer main.pd \; # knob1 knob2 knob3 knob4 volume expression foot_switch aux (RANGE 0-100) --- do not delete this line \; 0 0 0 0 70 0 0 0 \;;
